WEBVTT

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:16.517
Good morning! I'm Ino Sakura!

00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:18.477
I'm Roko Sekino.

00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:20.479
I'm Hayu Nukui!

00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:22.105
I'm Nina Maehara!

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:25.442
We're an idol group called Fruit Tart!

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:29.029
To all of you who are working hard
at work or school every morning...

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:30.948
We're here...

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:33.116
...to cheer you on!

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:36.620
I wanna go home...

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.205
"Episode 2" "Dropout Idol Fruit Tart"
"Charge! Supporting Everyone's New Life!"
"Train Station Cheering Squad"

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:40.040
"Episode 2" "Dropout Idol Fruit Tart"
"Charge! Supporting Everyone's New Life!"
"Train Station Cheering Squad"
Who are we cheering for anyway?!

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:21.517
"A Rocking New Semester!"

00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:23.769
"A Rocking New Semester!"
A Rocking New Semester!

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:25.103
"A Rocking New Semester!"

00:02:28.398 --> 00:02:31.026
It's been two weeks since I moved to Tokyo
from the countryside of Okayama

00:02:31.026 --> 00:02:33.195
to pursue my dream of becoming an idol.

00:02:33.195 --> 00:02:37.366
I'm finally getting adjusted into
my life here at Mouse House.

00:02:41.245 --> 00:02:43.330
I'm starting a new semester at school today!

00:02:51.213 --> 00:02:52.965
Ah, that smells good.

00:02:52.965 --> 00:02:54.258
Are we having Japanese breakfast today?

00:02:54.258 --> 00:02:56.844
Ah, good morning, Miss Hoho!

00:02:56.844 --> 00:02:58.720
This is Miss Hoho Kajino.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:02.224
She's the manager from
our agency, Rat Productions.

00:03:02.224 --> 00:03:04.518
Miss Hoho, did you stay up all night again?

00:03:04.518 --> 00:03:08.313
Yeah, the prices were
fluctuating all night last night.

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:10.107
Prices? Fluctuating?

00:03:11.066 --> 00:03:14.152
So, how did work go last night?

00:03:14.152 --> 00:03:15.571
What?!

00:03:15.571 --> 00:03:21.201
Well, a daily allowance of 300 yen
is often the case for a salaried worker...

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:24.997
You seem to be saving regularly. It's admirable!

00:03:25.831 --> 00:03:28.166
I'm loving the apron over uniform look.

00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:29.209
Oh, nothing.

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:31.128
Anyway, you're starting school today, right?

00:03:31.128 --> 00:03:32.462
Are you okay on time?

00:03:32.462 --> 00:03:33.755
Oh, that's right!

00:03:33.755 --> 00:03:35.674
I'm going to go wake everybody up!

00:03:35.674 --> 00:03:37.509
Appreciate your help, always!

00:03:37.509 --> 00:03:38.552
Huh?

00:03:38.552 --> 00:03:41.430
I feel like I'm making you
do maid work all the time.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.265
Oh, it's quite all right.

00:03:43.265 --> 00:03:47.019
I'd prefer Roko-<i>sempai </i>to be my master--

00:03:47.019 --> 00:03:50.439
I am delighted to take care of
my seniors who inspire me!

00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:53.400
What?! What did you say just now?!

00:03:55.527 --> 00:03:57.196
Roko-<i>sempai</i>!

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:07.706
I'm so happy I get to
take care of Roko-<i>sempai </i>like this!

00:04:07.706 --> 00:04:11.960
I especially love the moment I wake her up...!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:14.755
Roko-<i>sempai</i>, I'm coming in.

00:04:14.755 --> 00:04:17.216
Roko-<i>sempai</i>, it's time to get up.

00:04:17.216 --> 00:04:19.301
You need to wake up or else...

00:04:25.224 --> 00:04:26.558
Huh?!

00:04:26.558 --> 00:04:27.518
Huh?

00:04:32.564 --> 00:04:35.234
What was that about so early in the morning?

00:04:36.401 --> 00:04:37.569
I'm sleepy...

00:04:37.569 --> 00:04:40.280
Hey! Wh-Wh-What in the world in going on here?!

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.240
What?

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:45.994
Sleeping together like that!
I-Isn't that scandalous or something?!

00:04:45.994 --> 00:04:48.205
What are you talking about?

00:04:49.748 --> 00:04:51.834
This isn't what you think.

00:04:51.834 --> 00:04:54.545
Nina sometimes sneaks into my bed.

00:04:54.545 --> 00:04:57.464
And I'm always telling her that it's annoying...

00:04:57.464 --> 00:05:00.509
What? But it was thundering last night.

00:05:00.509 --> 00:05:03.637
Roko, you hate thunder and scary TV shows!

00:05:03.637 --> 00:05:05.347
That's why!

00:05:05.347 --> 00:05:09.685
I come to sleep with you, so you'd feel safe.

00:05:09.685 --> 00:05:14.523
Plus, you always cuddle me tight
on nights like that.

00:05:14.523 --> 00:05:16.733
Huh? What is this?!

00:05:17.651 --> 00:05:21.363
There's no time for squeezing!
It's time for breakfast!

00:05:21.363 --> 00:05:22.906
We start school today.

00:05:22.906 --> 00:05:25.450
We don't want to be late
on our first day, right?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.327
Please change into your clothes.

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:30.873
--I still need to go wake up Hayu.
--What?

00:05:30.873 --> 00:05:33.959
Hayu? I advise you to wait a little longer...

00:05:33.959 --> 00:05:36.420
Gosh, don't be ridiculous.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:39.339
We all need to eat breakfast together!

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:44.887
Wake up... breakfast...
school... pay back... debt...

00:05:44.887 --> 00:05:46.513
H-Hayu?!

00:05:46.513 --> 00:05:48.724
Hayu's not a morning person.

00:05:48.724 --> 00:05:52.019
She gets like this when she wakes up before 9am.

00:05:52.019 --> 00:05:54.646
What? But yesterday morning...!

00:05:54.646 --> 00:05:56.899
When this happens...

00:05:56.899 --> 00:05:58.859
...strawberries do the trick.

00:05:58.859 --> 00:06:01.695
Look, Hayu, I've got some strawberries!

00:06:03.739 --> 00:06:06.325
Good morning, Inocchi and everyone!

00:06:06.325 --> 00:06:08.952
Let's do our absolute best again today!

00:06:08.952 --> 00:06:10.579
What did I say?

00:06:10.579 --> 00:06:13.290
Are those strawberries laced with something?

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:14.458
Yay!

00:06:31.642 --> 00:06:34.853
Oooh! Can't beat uniforms, can you?

00:06:34.853 --> 00:06:37.606
You all look like delicious unripen fruit.

00:06:37.606 --> 00:06:38.941
You sound like a perv!

00:06:38.941 --> 00:06:42.903
Oh, but you all should
disguise yourselves a little.

00:06:42.903 --> 00:06:45.531
You're all officially idols now.

00:06:45.531 --> 00:06:47.741
Try not to cause a nuisance.

00:06:47.741 --> 00:06:49.493
You're right.

00:06:49.493 --> 00:06:54.081
It's probably a wise idea to
keep it discreet from others in general.

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:56.875
"The price of fame"

00:06:57.709 --> 00:06:58.752
Then...

00:06:58.752 --> 00:07:01.839
This ought to do it!
Nobody will notice who we are!

00:07:01.839 --> 00:07:02.714
Yup, yup!

00:07:02.714 --> 00:07:03.632
What's wrong with them?

00:07:03.632 --> 00:07:05.050
They look suspicious!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:08.136
We ended up attracting way too much attention.

00:07:08.136 --> 00:07:10.305
We're going this way now.

00:07:10.305 --> 00:07:13.225
What? Roko-<i>sempai</i>,
you two go to a different school?

00:07:13.225 --> 00:07:15.310
Obviously. Our uniforms are different.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:17.354
Ah, now that you mention it...

00:07:17.354 --> 00:07:20.524
But I feel anxious being
separated from you both.

00:07:20.524 --> 00:07:22.109
Don't be ridiculous, Ino.

00:07:22.109 --> 00:07:26.488
Each of us has the responsibility to
accomplish work and school ourselves.

00:07:26.488 --> 00:07:30.284
We're officially idols, working as a team!

00:07:30.284 --> 00:07:32.744
Roko-<i>sempai</i>...

00:07:32.744 --> 00:07:34.538
--See ya!
--Roko!

00:07:34.538 --> 00:07:35.372
Huh?

00:07:35.372 --> 00:07:39.501
Roko, you're headed in the direction of
the elementary school, not the high school.

00:07:41.086 --> 00:07:43.797
But Roko's exactly right, Inocchi.

00:07:43.797 --> 00:07:47.092
We just have to do our best
with the things we can do.

00:07:47.092 --> 00:07:51.597
Sure, new ventures are nerve-racking,
but I bet it'll be lots of fun, too!

00:07:51.597 --> 00:07:53.515
Yes, you're right!

00:07:54.516 --> 00:07:56.393
"Ino and Hayu's Private High School"
"Koganei Academy"

00:07:56.393 --> 00:07:58.395
"Entrance Ceremony"
"Koganei Academy"

00:07:58.687 --> 00:08:00.397
I know I said it'll be fun,

00:08:00.397 --> 00:08:01.773
b-but what should I do?

00:08:01.773 --> 00:08:04.026
--Word will get out eventually anyway...
--I'm Ryoko Ishida, nice to meet you all!

00:08:04.026 --> 00:08:06.445
--Maybe I should reveal that
I'm an idol already...?
--I'm Ryoko Ishida, nice to meet you all!

00:08:06.445 --> 00:08:09.239
--Maybe I should reveal that
I'm an idol already...?

00:08:09.239 --> 00:08:11.950
But we haven't even released a CD yet.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.452
All right, next person!

00:08:13.452 --> 00:08:15.037
Oh, y-yes!

00:08:15.037 --> 00:08:17.748
Roll call #7, I'm Ino Sakura.

00:08:17.748 --> 00:08:19.833
I'm working hard to pay back my debts.

00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:21.710
What?!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.837
I totally bombed that, didn't I?

00:08:23.837 --> 00:08:27.007
Everyone must think I'm a weirdo now!

00:08:27.007 --> 00:08:28.217
Inocchi!

00:08:30.385 --> 00:08:31.845
Hayu?!

00:08:31.845 --> 00:08:34.806
Are you about to save me from this tragedy?!

00:08:34.806 --> 00:08:37.142
Yes, yes!

00:08:37.142 --> 00:08:39.478
My name is Hayu Nukui.

00:08:39.478 --> 00:08:43.106
Along with Inocchi Sakura, here, I'm also
in the process of paying back my debt!

00:08:43.106 --> 00:08:44.316
What?!

00:08:44.316 --> 00:08:47.569
N-No! It's really not like that!
You're all mistaken!

00:08:47.569 --> 00:08:50.697
Hayu and I aren't debt buddies!

00:08:50.697 --> 00:08:52.407
We're actually...

00:08:52.407 --> 00:08:57.246
Shoot, this is bad.
I better just tell the truth...

00:08:57.246 --> 00:09:00.707
W-We've got a purely innocent
relationship with each other!

00:09:00.707 --> 00:09:02.042
What?!

00:09:03.335 --> 00:09:07.965
Oh no, now we're officially
the weirdos of our class.

00:09:07.965 --> 00:09:09.842
There goes my debut as a high-school student...

00:09:09.842 --> 00:09:11.468
Your debut...?

00:09:11.468 --> 00:09:15.597
Yes, the school I attended in
the countryside had very few students.

00:09:15.597 --> 00:09:17.724
"Okayama 'Something-something' School"
"5 students total!!"
Yes, the school I attended in
the countryside had very few students.

00:09:17.724 --> 00:09:22.396
That's why I was hoping to make new friends
that are the same grade as me here.

00:09:22.396 --> 00:09:26.441
But don't forget, Inocchi... that you have me!

00:09:26.441 --> 00:09:29.361
I'm your classmate, too, you know?

00:09:29.361 --> 00:09:34.992
S-So, would it be okay if I were
your first friend in the same grade?

00:09:37.703 --> 00:09:39.288
You're absolutely right!

00:09:39.288 --> 00:09:44.793
Then I'd like to officially be friends with you
at school, not just at home, Hayu!

00:09:44.793 --> 00:09:46.837
O-Of course, Inocchi!

00:09:46.837 --> 00:09:49.715
Let's work hard together
from here on out and make that money.

00:09:49.715 --> 00:09:50.591
Yes!

00:09:50.591 --> 00:09:51.633
What?!

00:09:51.633 --> 00:09:53.177
"Welcome to the Newspaper Club"
"Girls Basketball Club Members"
"Koganei Academy Wind Ensemble"
"Band Club"

00:09:53.552 --> 00:09:57.014
School life in the city is so impressive.

00:09:57.014 --> 00:09:58.473
Huh? How's that?

00:09:58.473 --> 00:10:03.020
Everyone's so stylish and pretty.
They're all shining like celebrities.

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:06.064
What's the difference between
a celebrity and a regular person?

00:10:06.064 --> 00:10:08.859
D-Don't think too much of it, Inocchi!

00:10:08.859 --> 00:10:11.695
--It's easy to say for you, Hayu!
--Huh?

00:10:11.695 --> 00:10:14.531
You're skinny, cool, and skinny!

00:10:14.531 --> 00:10:17.242
Did you do anything special in junior high?

00:10:17.242 --> 00:10:18.493
Sure, you can say that.

00:10:18.493 --> 00:10:20.954
I did music, though, not sports.

00:10:20.954 --> 00:10:24.249
I didn't have any friends,
band club and work were non-existent,

00:10:24.249 --> 00:10:26.543
so I would perform solo by the river.

00:10:26.543 --> 00:10:27.836
What?! Inocchi?!

00:10:27.836 --> 00:10:31.340
I-I'm here for you now, Hayu.
It's all going to be okay!

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:33.675
I was just telling you that!

00:10:33.675 --> 00:10:39.598
But I wonder why there are so many girls
when this school's supposed to be co-ed?

00:10:39.598 --> 00:10:42.893
Oh, that's because it used to be
an all-girls school until last year.

00:10:42.893 --> 00:10:45.646
They say boys are a minority
at those kinds of schools.

00:10:45.646 --> 00:10:47.105
Oh, I see!

00:10:47.105 --> 00:10:50.692
And just like you, Inocchi, maybe there
are more girls who likes girls, too!

00:10:50.692 --> 00:10:51.610
What?!

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:54.112
Huh?! W-Wait! You're mistaken!

00:10:54.112 --> 00:10:55.447
We're back!

00:10:55.447 --> 00:10:56.823
Welcome back.

00:10:56.823 --> 00:10:58.700
How was school?

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:01.036
Nobody recognized us at all.

00:11:01.036 --> 00:11:02.496
Oh, right.

00:11:02.496 --> 00:11:05.332
Nobody noticed us this year, either.

00:11:05.332 --> 00:11:08.335
I was all prepared for nothing.

00:11:09.211 --> 00:11:12.548
I've got 10 years of experience under my belt...

00:11:12.548 --> 00:11:14.591
R-Roko-<i>sempai</i>!

00:11:14.591 --> 00:11:17.678
We need to do something about this, everyone!

00:11:17.678 --> 00:11:20.138
We need to think of a plan...

00:11:20.138 --> 00:11:22.307
Think of a plan? This late in the game?

00:11:22.307 --> 00:11:25.686
U-Um... You know, something that would
make the show more entertaining!

00:11:25.686 --> 00:11:26.562
Oh!

00:11:26.562 --> 00:11:28.355
"Boobs, guaranteed."

00:11:28.355 --> 00:11:30.148
That can't be!

00:11:32.651 --> 00:11:36.405
That's why I'm here to bring
you all the best episode ideas!

00:11:36.405 --> 00:11:38.532
You're so abrupt as always, Hoho.

00:11:38.532 --> 00:11:40.158
Let's see what we get!

00:11:40.951 --> 00:11:42.411
"Secret"

00:11:42.411 --> 00:11:44.997
"Secret"
Can't you put a little more effort into this?

00:11:44.997 --> 00:11:47.249
W-Well, why don't we roll it anyway?

00:11:47.249 --> 00:11:49.543
I'm curious to see what it says!

00:11:49.543 --> 00:11:50.836
All right.

00:11:50.836 --> 00:11:51.920
Go!

00:11:52.045 --> 00:11:54.715
"Secret"

00:11:54.715 --> 00:11:56.216
"Roll again"

00:11:56.967 --> 00:11:57.676
Ha!

00:11:57.676 --> 00:11:59.052
"Roll again"

00:11:59.386 --> 00:12:00.637
Come on!

00:12:01.096 --> 00:12:03.765
"Roll again"

00:12:03.765 --> 00:12:04.766
"Write a song and release a CD!!"

00:12:04.766 --> 00:12:06.351
"Write a song and release a CD!!"
This was the only outcome!

00:12:06.351 --> 00:12:06.935
"CD debut decided!!"

00:12:06.935 --> 00:12:09.313
"CD debut decided!!"
What??!

00:12:09.313 --> 00:12:10.856
I'm Roko Sekino. A former child actor,

00:12:10.856 --> 00:12:13.066
a 2nd year in high school,
and my birthday is May 5th.

00:12:13.066 --> 00:12:15.402
Blood type is B and my height is 14--

00:12:15.402 --> 00:12:16.945
That's unnecessary info!

00:12:16.945 --> 00:12:19.072
I like period dramas!

00:12:26.455 --> 00:12:28.832
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:12:29.124 --> 00:12:30.751
"Episode 3"
"Write a song and release a CD!!"

00:12:30.792 --> 00:12:35.255
We're told to write a song,
but where do we even start?

00:12:35.255 --> 00:12:37.216
Yeah, I have no clue.

00:12:38.509 --> 00:12:40.093
Ah! I know!

00:12:40.093 --> 00:12:42.513
What do you all listen to usually?

00:12:42.513 --> 00:12:45.641
I mostly listen to pop and cheerful music.

00:12:45.641 --> 00:12:47.768
I listen to rock, of course.

00:12:47.768 --> 00:12:50.229
I listen to ballads.

00:12:50.229 --> 00:12:51.355
I listen to <i>rakugo</i>.

00:12:51.355 --> 00:12:52.773
Rakugo?!

00:12:52.773 --> 00:12:55.817
Wh-Whatever! It shouldn't matter what I like!

00:12:55.817 --> 00:12:56.944
Have something to say?!

00:12:56.944 --> 00:12:58.487
No, I'm sorry!

00:12:58.487 --> 00:13:00.405
I just didn't expect it, is all.

00:13:00.405 --> 00:13:03.867
B-But I wonder what genre <i>rakugo </i>falls in.

00:13:03.867 --> 00:13:04.743
What?

00:13:04.743 --> 00:13:07.371
Roko-<i>sempai </i>performing <i>rakugo</i>...

00:13:07.371 --> 00:13:07.621
"Kyusotei Roko"
Roko-<i>sempai </i>performing <i>rakugo</i>...

00:13:07.621 --> 00:13:12.167
"Kyusotei Roko"
Yes, she sells shea sells by the she soar...

00:13:12.167 --> 00:13:13.669
It belongs in the "cute" genre!

00:13:13.669 --> 00:13:15.337
You okay in the head?

00:13:15.337 --> 00:13:18.757
Despite her looks, Roko's got old man tastes.

00:13:18.757 --> 00:13:20.259
What do you mean "despite my looks"?!

00:13:20.259 --> 00:13:21.969
Self-conscious, much?

00:13:21.969 --> 00:13:22.803
Heh.

00:13:22.803 --> 00:13:27.850
Beside <i>rakugo</i>, I love period dramas, kabuki
theater, <i>enka</i>, bonsai and Japanese painting.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:31.061
How could you not understand
the splendor of Japanese culture?

00:13:31.061 --> 00:13:33.772
You really do love traditional culture.

00:13:33.772 --> 00:13:35.065
She really does!

00:13:35.065 --> 00:13:38.110
I sometimes catch her
sword fighting in her room.

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:39.903
Hey! That's enough!

00:13:39.903 --> 00:13:44.658
Ah! Then why don't we try to
get inspired by our favorite things?

00:13:44.658 --> 00:13:45.659
Makes sense.

00:13:45.659 --> 00:13:50.581
That'll help us come up with a song
and we'll get to know each other better!

00:13:50.581 --> 00:13:52.416
Roko likes Japanese culture.

00:13:52.416 --> 00:13:54.209
I like anything rock 'n' roll!

00:13:54.209 --> 00:13:55.669
Plus superheroes!

00:13:55.669 --> 00:13:59.089
Yes, yes! And I like Roko-<i>sempai</i>!

00:13:59.923 --> 00:14:01.049
Cut it out!

00:14:01.049 --> 00:14:01.925
How about you, Nina?

00:14:01.925 --> 00:14:05.012
What? Um... I like girl smells.

00:14:05.012 --> 00:14:06.388
What?!

00:14:07.306 --> 00:14:09.725
N-No! That's not what I meant!

00:14:09.725 --> 00:14:13.103
I like the smell of things
like flowers and herbs!

00:14:13.103 --> 00:14:15.689
I didn't mean anything weird!

00:14:15.689 --> 00:14:19.151
Come to think of it, you always
smell nice, Nina-<i>sempai</i>.

00:14:19.151 --> 00:14:20.360
--What?!
--It's a slightly sweet, calming smell!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:23.238
--It's a slightly sweet, calming smell!

00:14:23.238 --> 00:14:24.239
Yup.

00:14:24.239 --> 00:14:26.700
An ideal mother's smell.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:27.951
Mother's smell...

00:14:27.951 --> 00:14:28.827
Gosh!

00:14:28.827 --> 00:14:30.954
It's just the smell of my detergent!

00:14:30.954 --> 00:14:33.874
You each have a unique smell, too, you know?!

00:14:33.874 --> 00:14:34.708
What?

00:14:34.708 --> 00:14:37.544
Ino, you smell fresh and green!

00:14:37.544 --> 00:14:41.089
Are you saying that I'm still
green and inexperienced?!

00:14:41.089 --> 00:14:42.591
Roko, you smell like...

00:14:42.591 --> 00:14:44.510
Um... Well...

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:46.136
Um...

00:14:46.136 --> 00:14:47.471
It's fine.

00:14:47.471 --> 00:14:48.805
I can tell what you're trying to say.

00:14:48.805 --> 00:14:50.516
"Answer: Milk"
I can tell what you're trying to say.

00:14:50.516 --> 00:14:52.684
And Hayu smells like...

00:14:52.684 --> 00:14:57.147
Th-That's okay, I'm clumsy
and not girly at all...

00:14:57.147 --> 00:15:00.609
No, that's not true at all, Hayu.

00:15:01.944 --> 00:15:05.739
You smell really good, too, Hayu.

00:15:05.739 --> 00:15:07.241
Nina...

00:15:07.241 --> 00:15:08.367
What is this...?

00:15:08.367 --> 00:15:09.451
Whoa!

00:15:09.451 --> 00:15:12.788
Get off each other already! This has
nothing to do with the song now.

00:15:12.788 --> 00:15:14.957
The viewers are gonna think we're crazy!

00:15:14.957 --> 00:15:16.416
We're all over the place!

00:15:16.416 --> 00:15:19.378
Isn't there something we all like?!

00:15:19.378 --> 00:15:20.420
Hmm...

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.547
Something...

00:15:21.547 --> 00:15:23.882
...we all like...?

00:15:25.509 --> 00:15:26.927
Curry!

00:15:26.927 --> 00:15:27.845
Hm?

00:15:27.845 --> 00:15:29.555
Hoho, you're not motivated at all, are you?

00:15:29.555 --> 00:15:32.307
Singing about curry for your debut single
isn't what I had in mind...

00:15:32.307 --> 00:15:33.767
Whose fault is that?!

00:15:33.767 --> 00:15:35.602
Oh, it's lunch time already.

00:15:35.602 --> 00:15:38.105
Let's have some curry for lunch, shall we?

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:40.941
Oh no!

00:15:40.941 --> 00:15:43.026
The only pride of Mouse House!

00:15:43.026 --> 00:15:45.529
Curry's the only pride?!

00:15:47.281 --> 00:15:51.535
We decided to go grocery shopping
since we didn't have anything to eat...

00:15:51.535 --> 00:15:52.619
Um...

00:15:52.619 --> 00:15:55.247
We could only scrape up 520 yen?!

00:15:56.164 --> 00:15:59.376
We could probably buy lots of bread crusts.

00:15:59.376 --> 00:16:01.837
Huh? Where's Ino?

00:16:01.837 --> 00:16:03.172
What the heck?!

00:16:03.172 --> 00:16:05.132
O-Oh, um...

00:16:05.132 --> 00:16:06.925
Ino, take this with you.

00:16:06.925 --> 00:16:08.677
Th-Thank you very much!

00:16:08.677 --> 00:16:10.679
Here you go, I just harvested it this morning.

00:16:10.679 --> 00:16:12.472
Th-Thank you very much!

00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:14.141
We're all rooting for you.

00:16:14.141 --> 00:16:16.310
Thank you very much!

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:20.814
When I mentioned that we didn't have any money,
everyone generously gave us food.

00:16:20.814 --> 00:16:24.568
When it comes to popularity,
I think Ino trumps us all.

00:16:24.568 --> 00:16:27.362
Well thanks to that,
we're good on food for a while now.

00:16:27.362 --> 00:16:30.115
Seriously. Thanks, neighbors!

00:16:30.115 --> 00:16:34.536
I've come to love this town and the people here!

00:16:34.536 --> 00:16:35.829
Ino...

00:16:35.829 --> 00:16:40.125
I know! What if we sing about
Mouse House for our debut song?

00:16:40.125 --> 00:16:41.168
What?

00:16:41.168 --> 00:16:42.669
A song about Mouse House?

00:16:42.669 --> 00:16:43.629
Yes!

00:16:43.629 --> 00:16:46.173
If listeners can know us better
through our song,

00:16:46.173 --> 00:16:50.469
I thought maybe we could
be friends with more people!

00:16:50.469 --> 00:16:52.095
You've got a point there.

00:16:52.095 --> 00:16:54.431
We need people to know us better!

00:16:54.431 --> 00:16:55.390
Yup!

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:58.310
All right! Let's go home and work on the song!

00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.520
Yeah!

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:02.022
"Koganei Academy"

00:17:03.357 --> 00:17:04.525
It's actually really hard
to write about ourselves.

00:17:04.525 --> 00:17:07.194
"In charge of lyrics"

00:17:07.194 --> 00:17:08.028
"In charge of lyrics"

00:17:08.028 --> 00:17:11.114
"In charge of lyrics"
"In charge of music"
It's true. You can't be too realistic
or else it wouldn't work.

00:17:11.114 --> 00:17:14.201
Like today, I'm wearing underwear
and socks with holes in them.

00:17:14.201 --> 00:17:16.703
We can't be realistic at all!

00:17:16.703 --> 00:17:20.916
You need to be better about that, Hayu.
We're idols now.

00:17:20.916 --> 00:17:23.293
Why?! They're totally fine to wear

00:17:23.293 --> 00:17:26.880
and it costs a Mr. Noguchi for three pairs!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:29.174
What? Is that an issue?

00:17:29.174 --> 00:17:32.094
What?! How could you say that, Inocchi?!

00:17:32.094 --> 00:17:36.181
Th-Then you're better off spending
that Mr. Noguchi for 10 loaves of bread!

00:17:36.181 --> 00:17:39.142
You can't eat underwear, you know?!

00:17:39.142 --> 00:17:41.103
Oh, she's hopeless.

00:17:41.103 --> 00:17:45.649
Th-Then why don't we stop by the cute
lingerie store by the station next time?

00:17:45.649 --> 00:17:46.608
What?

00:17:46.608 --> 00:17:48.569
Let's heighten our standards!

00:17:48.569 --> 00:17:51.613
D-Do you mean that store
with all the frilly things?

00:17:51.613 --> 00:17:54.241
You've never been before, Hayu?

00:17:55.742 --> 00:17:59.538
W-Well... It's embarrassing
to go into those kinds of stores...

00:17:59.538 --> 00:18:00.414
--Plus, I have a small chest
so the lingerie won't even look cute...

00:18:00.414 --> 00:18:03.208
--Huh? What is this feeling?
--Plus, I have a small chest
so the lingerie won't even look cute...

00:18:03.667 --> 00:18:05.169
