"Koganei Chuo High School"

00:18:08.797 --> 00:18:12.050
Hey, how did I end up being the choreographer?

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.177
What?! W-Well, that's because...

00:18:13.177 --> 00:18:14.178
"In charge of choreography"
"In charge of wardrobe"
