R-Roko! I can eat that broccoli for you!

00:18:32.196 --> 00:18:33.238
Hm?

00:18:33.238 --> 00:18:35.782
She's totally fine with it.

00:18:35.782 --> 00:18:39.411
Nina, you're really good at making clothes.

00:18:39.411 --> 00:18:40.329
What?

00:18:40.329 --> 00:18:43.874
You can even make your own clothes, too.

00:18:43.874 --> 00:18:47.377
I went into this industry
