genius beauty, Chiko Sekino.

00:20:38.405 --> 00:20:42.117
She's got serious singing chops as
a junior high school student.

00:20:42.117 --> 00:20:44.203
Her sidekicks are the popular twin talents,

00:20:44.203 --> 00:20:48.457
